  "details": "Add support for the DecaMove SDK, as it allows for remapping of the DecaMove's button to perform actions in a game, and you can even use the DecaMove's raw rotational data and apply it to avatars to have hip rotation on avatars. This can help with immersion and inventory systems (even though VRChat does not have an inventory system)",
